+# Design system: shadcn/ui
+
+Decided on 2026-10-16 by [[Priya Raman]] and [[Kenji Watanabe]].
+
+## Decision
+Design system is **shadcn/ui**. The team will replace the Tailwind UI kit with shadcn/ui.
+
+## Why
+Agreed by the design and engineering leads to better component coverage and developer ergonomics.
+
+This replaces [[Decision - Design system is Tailwind UI kit]], which is no longer current.
+
+## Context
+Priya and Kenji will coordinate the migration and update the design documentation.
